    {
      "Text": "Qt is a software toolkit for developing applications.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nQDomDocument XML parsing is vulnerable to a remotely-triggerable denial-of-service crash when processing untrusted input.(CVE-2026-19248)",
